<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-15360] .NET: verify-nuget.ps1 fails if .NET 5 is installed</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15360</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;verify-nuget.ps1 fails if .NET 5 is installed:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
error: NU1101: Unable to find &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;package&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.Configuration.ConfigurationManager. No packages exist with &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;this&lt;/span&gt; id in source(s): C:\BuildAgent\work\7bc1c54bc719b67c\modules\platforms\dotnet\nupkg
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Looks like NuGet restore behavior has changed in .NET 5 when &quot;-s&quot; option is present and it can&apos;t find ConfigurationManager on Nuget.org when a custom source is specified.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
